WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.826
Every run leaves me exhausted. I need a plan.

2
00:00:04.206 --> 00:00:08.468
I can train four days a week. Can you help?

3
00:00:08.648 --> 00:00:14.028
Yes. Let’s use your recent training to balance running and strength.

4
00:00:14.558 --> 00:00:16.200
Great. Save my plan.

5
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.770
Saved. Shall I send these three runs?

6
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.867
Yes, send them.

7
00:00:26.947 --> 00:00:29.487
Today, I’ll follow my watch.

8
00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:35.732
This time, I finished with energy to spare.

9
00:00:35.982 --> 00:00:38.906
Great. Let’s review next week together.
